      "writtenOn": "2026-11-13T09:56:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Color is keyed by the sorted index of the current cloud set into a 10-color palette, so once more than 10 clouds are active in the window two clouds share a color (ambiguous legend), and a cloud\u0027s color shifts between regens as the set changes. The tooltip still names the cloud, so this is cosmetic. A stable name-based mapping fixes the drift; a larger palette (the heatmap uses 100) reduces collisions.",
      "revId": "b47f58fe11cc13d7091d4d428529da73f4eb69fe",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
