      "side": 1,
      "message": "This writes allocation-graphic.html into the shared visual_web_dir. The heatmap index generator (tools/simple_table_web.py:46-51) rebuilds index.html from every *.html except current/next/index, so after any --regen-heatmap run the \"All Time\" page (/visual/) shows a stray \"allocation-graphic\" link; clicking it hits /visual/allocation-graphic.html, which the /\u003cwhen\u003e route serves through visuals.html, so the graphic renders under a \"Monthly Usage\" heading instead of its own /visual/graph page (verified with the test client). Consider writing to a dedicated subdir (for example visual_web_dir/graph/) read by the /graph route, so the heatmap os.listdir glob never sweeps it.",
